{"speciesId":620,"names":{"fr":"Shaofouine","es":"Mienshao","en":"Mienshao","ja":"コジョンド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il se sert des poils de ses pattes antérieures comme de fouets. Ses coups ultrarapides sont invisibles à l’œil nu."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It wields the fur on its arms like a whip. Its arm attacks come with such rapidity that they cannot even be seen."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il combat à l’aide des longs poils de ses pattes antérieures. Ils font aussi mal qu’un fouet."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They use the long fur on their arms as a whip to strike their opponents."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Using the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Using the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se sert des poils de ses pattes antérieures comme de fouets. Ses coups ultrarapides sont invisibles à l’œil nu."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Usa el pelaje de sus brazos a manera de látigos. Sus ataques alcanzan velocidades de vértigo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It wields the fur on its arms like a whip. Its arm attacks come with such rapidity that they cannot even be seen."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"腕の 体毛を ムチのように あつかう。両腕の 攻撃は 目にも 止まらぬ 速さ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il combat à l’aide des longs poils de ses pattes antérieures. Une fois lancé dans ses enchaînements, rien ne l’arrête."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Usa el pelaje de sus brazos a modo de látigos para encadenar ataques que nadie puede parar una vez iniciados."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Using the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"両手の 体毛を ムチのように 使いこなし 連続攻撃を はじめると だれにも 止められない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il se sert des poils de ses pattes antérieures comme de fouets. Ses coups ultrarapides sont invisibles à l’œil nu."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Usa el pelaje de sus brazos a manera de látigos. Sus ataques alcanzan velocidades de vértigo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It wields the fur on its arms like a whip. Its arm attacks come with such rapidity that they cannot even be seen."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"腕の 体毛を ムチのように あつかう。両腕の 攻撃は 目にも 止まらぬ 速さ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il combat à l’aide des longs poils de ses pattes antérieures. Une fois lancé dans ses enchaînements, rien ne l’arrête."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Usa el pelaje de sus brazos a modo de látigos para encadenar ataques que nadie puede parar una vez iniciados."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Using the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"両手の 体毛を ムチのように 使いこなし 連続攻撃を はじめると だれにも 止められない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il accule son ennemi avec une rafale d’attaques fulgurantes, puis concentre son énergie pour lui donner le coup de grâce."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ataca al rival con una rápida ráfaga de golpes, mientras reúne poco a poco la energía necesaria para asestar el golpe definitivo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It overwhelms its opponents with continuous attacks and then slowly stores up power before delivering the finishing blow."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"連続 攻撃で 相手を 圧倒する。 とどめの 一撃は ゆっくり 力を ためて 放つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Le cri lugubre de Shaofouine annonce qu’il est sur le point de déchaîner une pluie de coups si rapides qu’ils en sont invisibles."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Si emite extraños aullidos, hay que extremar la precaución: empezará a repartir un sinfín de patadas y puñetazos a una velocidad pasmosa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"When Mienshao lets out a bizarre wail, you’re in danger. A flurry of kicks and chops too fast to see is about to be unleashed!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"奇妙な声で 吠えたら 危険。 目にも止まらぬ キックや チョップの 連続攻撃が 始まるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Lorsqu’il fait face à un adversaire vraiment redoutable, il coupe les poils de ses mains avec les dents pour améliorer son agilité."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando se encuentra frente a un oponente de categoría, se arranca parte del pelaje de los brazos a mordiscos para ganar agilidad."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When Mienshao comes across a truly challenging opponent, it will lighten itself by biting off the fur on its arms."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"真の 強敵と 会うと 身軽に なるため 両手の 毛を 噛み千切り 捨ててしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses coups de pied ultrarapides et invisibles à l’œil nu peuvent réduire un énorme rocher en poussière."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Sus veloces patadas, que escapan al ojo humano, son capaces de reducir a escombros incluso rocas de gran tamaño."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Delivered at blinding speeds, kicks from this Pokémon can shatter massive boulders into tiny pieces."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"目にも 止まらぬ スピードで 繰りだす 蹴りは 巨大な 岩も 木っ端みじんに 砕く。"}],"varieties":[{"id":620,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[11,"level-up",17],[14,"level-up",17],[15,"level-up",17],[16,"level-up",17],[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17]]},{"name":"meg